[-] Build a walking-skeleton workspace daemon =kernel $Implement one local project session with an append-only event log, materialized current state, Git revision binding, checkpoints, and restart-safe status inspection. Keep adapters replaceable. Progress 2026-09-01: executable walking-skeleton scenarios S1-S7 plus claim supersession now cover scoped freshness, evidence gating, restart recovery, clean-base rollback, byte-accounted bounded perception, and explicit active-versus-retired belief projection. Kernel checkpoints/materialization efficiency and writer locking remain open.$ !1 +implementation ^2026-08-31T22:31 <contract #01a05b73-684a-7a30-8fae-7176691f63ef
[ ] Implement semantic locations and bounded working sets =working-set $Track path, symbol identity, revision, syntax fingerprint, reason-for-focus, navigation history, and stale observations. Support outline-to-symbol progressive disclosure without copying whole files into session state.$ !1 +implementation ^2026-08-31T22:31 <kernel #01a05b73-6855-7791-83e4-0e7b6fcf9bb1
[ ] Implement findings and validation evidence =findings $Normalize diagnostics and command outcomes into a persistent quickfix-like queue while preserving native payloads, provenance, revision, dispositions, and evidence invalidation after relevant changes.$ !1 +implementation ^2026-08-31T22:31 <working-set #01a05b73-6862-7411-adb5-bd229ccaa248
